<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39240" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">proxĭmĭtas</span></b> ,
			ātis, f.
		proximus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>nearness</i>, <i>vicinity</i>, <i>proximity.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i><span class="en">Vitr. 2, 9 <i>med.</i></span></i>; Ov. de Nuce, 56.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>Near relationship</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 10,
				340</span></i>; <i><span class="en">13, 154</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Quint. 3,
				6, 95</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Similarity</i>, <i>resemblance</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">et lateat vitium proximitate boni,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. A.
					A. 2, 662</span></i>
			; Ap. Asclep. p. 79, 2.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<i>Connection</i>, <i>union</i>,
					<i><span class="en">App. Dogm. Plat. 2, p. 20,
		15</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
